## Android SDK Location
## In most environments with ANDROID_HOME or ANDROID_SDK_ROOT set, this file is not needed.
## If Gradle complains "SDK location not found", copy this file to 'android/local.properties' and set your path:

## Windows Example (note double backslashes \\):
# sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\YOUR_USERNAME\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk

## macOS Example:
# sdk.dir=/Users/YOUR_USERNAME/Library/Android/sdk

## Linux Example:
# sdk.dir=/home/YOUR_USERNAME/Android/Sdk
